        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8041, Grade 1 Low Profile Traditional Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>The classic design of this Baldwin made single cylinder deadbolt means that it is a great choice for traditional style homes. An ANSI Grade 1, it features a specially designed strike with four security jamb screws and an armored front to conceal the fasteners. A single cylinder door lock, the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn from the inside. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It will fit 1-5/8\" door cutouts on 1-3/4\" thick doors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou'll find the quality, peace of mind and beauty you expect from Baldwin in every lock. A heavy gauge steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts gives this ANSI Grade 1, the highest level security, door lock both strength and durability that is backed by a lifetime limited mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a thumbturn from the interior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available:<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-double-cylinder-deadbolt-for-1-5-8-inch-door-preparations-baldwin-8021\"><b>Traditional Double Cylinder Deadbolt For 1-5/8\" Door Preparations</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/low-profile-traditional-single-cylinder-deadbolt-for-2-1-8-inch-door-cutout-baldwin-8231\"><b>Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt For 2-1/8\" Door Preparations</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8041 Traditional Single Cylinder Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1:  Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 1-5/8\" diameter cutouts</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
